WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Plan a clear, level route and destination.
Keep your usual mobility support.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
A power-wheelchair route is shown.
This is not chair-driving or gait training.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Pause if tired or unsteady.
Follow the guidance for your own equipment.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Example replay: clear space ahead.
Walking may need an aid or a helper.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Ask about turns, doorways and transfers.
Do not practise backward steps alone.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A final route-planning example.
Your way of getting around can differ.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Arrive, rest and reflect.
Ask for an assessment if your needs change.
